    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:754.1094px;height:14px;font:normal 300 12px Ubuntu, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "The tab covers the whole window, its bar and every pane around it. Escape or the same button brings it back. Full screen in the tab's right-click </div>",
